+        v
+FINALIZANDO + cancelRequestedAt
+        |
+        v
+runner-sample / runner-control => command=ABORT
+        |
+        v
+runner-stop-ack
+        |
+        v
+exec.test.abort(...)
+        |
+        v
+teardown()
+        |
+        v
+runner-finish
+        |
+        v
+espera breve de requests/SQL/pool en vuelo
+        |
+        v
+ABORTADA_MANUAL
+```
